  "comment": [
    "Golden vectors for deltas (docs/scm.md, \"Deltas\").",
    "internal/scm/encoding (Go) must encode each valid vector's result against its base to exactly its",
    "delta, and both it and jj's encoding (Rust) must apply the delta to the base to exactly the result,",
    "and refuse every invalid vector's delta against its base, making at most limit bytes. A byte",
    "string is the concatenation of its lines, each hex."
